This file provides licensing information on the code provided in this repository.

The repository uses BSD-3-Clause throughout. `REUSE.toml` and `LICENSES/` carry the same
information in a machine-readable form, and the repository is compliant with version 3.3 of
the REUSE specification.

Two copyright holders are involved:

- The driver sources under each series directory -- for example `n32g45x/CMSIS/` and
  `n32g45x/n32g45x_std_periph_driver/` -- are imported verbatim from the upstream vendor SDK
  and remain Copyright (c) 2019, 2025 Nations Technologies Inc. They are reproduced without
  modification and keep their original headers. The package each series was taken from is
  recorded in that series' README.
- All other files are Copyright (c) 2026 Nsing Technologies Inc.

